<section class="section why-section" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
  <div class="why-heading">
    <p class="section-label">A deliberate boundary</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading" id="why-heading">Your global mise configuration stays yours.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="why-copy">
    <p>Powermise integrates with your installed mise executable and compiles a named <code>config.powermise-&lt;selection&gt;.toml</code> environment instead of rewriting your global configuration.</p>
    <p>Selections, provider validation, and generated output remain explicit, so the path from catalog entry to compiled configuration can be reviewed.</p>
    <a class="section-link" href="/mise-boundary/">Read the mise boundary <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
